{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1699439309"}, "name":{"label":"1 Swiftie Queen13 Gianna"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-22T10:25:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.92.6"}, "id":{"label":"14213652598"}, "title":{"label":"Get this app it’s amazing!!!! I HIGHLY RECOMMEND!!!!!!"}, "content":{"label":"This is a great app and I just absolutely love it! I’m not one to write reviews, but this app more than deserved it!! I used to be horrible at tracking water but this has me hooked!Filling up the characters brightens my day!!! This helps you get enough water intake which improves your mood, and efficiency in so many ways!!!! It will save you and make you the best you can be! This app is great and props and praise to the developers, great job making an adorable fun app!!!🦙💦❤️ This is such a great app that I bought the premium lifetime version at a great price. Just had to edit my review to say that. Without the premium it’s still fantastic, but with it, it brings you to a whole new level of super hydration power! This app is worth every penny, when I had the free version, I didn’t know what I was missing!Thank you thank you thank you soooo much Waterllama! I can’t express how grateful I am for such a great app. I highly highly recommend and I’m gonna tell all my friends about it!!!! It’s overall rated 4.9 stars, but it def deserves 20 more!!!!🤩🩷", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
