{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1654566727"}, "name":{"label":"LC_1234"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-18T19:11:59-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.92.6"}, "id":{"label":"14199606497"}, "title":{"label":"Doesn’t do much without a subscription"}, "content":{"label":"I was really excited to get this app because I thought it included more than one free feature. However that was not the case. You have to pay to track any beverage that is not water, you also have to pay a subscription to start any challenges, which is what got me excited about this app in the first place. On the contrary, this app can be very helpful for those who have trouble with drinking water throughout the day and can give users motivation to do good things for their body. To conclude, I was sad to find out you couldn’t do much on this app without paying a subscription, but this app did help me drink more water.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
