{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1254866393"}, "name":{"label":"a.mathews19"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-18T14:24:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.92.6"}, "id":{"label":"14198864631"}, "title":{"label":"Second time’s the charm!"}, "content":{"label":"I downloaded this app once and never ended up using it. I just recently downloaded it a bit ago and started using it regularly, this seriously works for me. \n\nThe consistent, timely notifications build up, when I ignore them, so I’m always drinking more to make up for the lost time. I have the notifications set for every 45 min to account for laziness but it seriously works. \n\nThe app is easy to use, the characters are fun, the custom message for your notifications is great. I wish I would’ve started using this app at the beginning, but I’m glad I’m using it now!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
