{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id682013764"}, "name":{"label":"pixels_7"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-17T10:11:46-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.92.6"}, "id":{"label":"14194201001"}, "title":{"label":"So Cute and So Easy"}, "content":{"label":"I just downloaded this yesterday, I’m trying to become more consistent with staying hydrated in any way I can. This app give me different ideas on how I can do that by not just simply drinking and tracking water but tracking other sources of hydration including foods! I’ve only had it a day though, so I haven’t come across any bugs or anything. It’d also very convenient you can pay up front to have the app fully and no subscription or you can choose a free trial for 3 days and then 9.99/yr. Which is not terrible for all of the additional hydration sources it provides. I plan to continue the trial and have a one year subscription. After that if it continues to show promise, I plan to purchase the app indefinitely and avoid annual charges. So far so good!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1910973726"}, "name":{"label":"Do you noa Roberts"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-17T08:45:28-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.92.6"}, "id":{"label":"14193910038"}, "title":{"label":"Too expensive and confusing"}, "content":{"label":"I wanted to drink more water and have a little app to remind me, but instead everything is just expensive and the app doesn’t allow you to track just one sip of water. You have to put the individual ounces into the app. Also, the notifications aren’t things like “uh oh it’s been a while since you drank water!” Or like “take a sip now” it’s all stuff like “oh buy our app, %78 off!!!” Do not recommend, try a different app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
